  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An invisible, intangible trap forms on the ground at a point you choose within range. The first time a creature comes within 5 feet of it, the trap bursts in a blast of frost and the spell ends. The triggering creature makes a Constitution saving throw; on a failure, it has the &amp;Reference[restrained apply=false]{Restrained} condition for 1 minute. The condition ends early if the creature takes any damage.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Bw1aMAqHp2s5XTCI\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use the save when a creature triggers the trap. Delete the Restrained effect if the creature takes damage.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
